# Rebuildable or third-party: font downloads, Python venv, the 2x fonts (tools/gen_fonts.py --scale 2: 37 MB, only
# used from UI scale 3.5, which no iPad reaches; without them the engine loads fonts@1.5x)
tools/downloads/
tools/.venv/
__pycache__/
Modding graphics/fonts@2x/
# Sprites exported from the original game data are not ours to publish; the manifest is metadata only
_originals/*
!_originals/manifest.json
# The repo's root .gitignore drops every *.ini; the mod's theme is part of the mod
!Modding graphics/theme.ini
